{"unit_id":"sorsama__deepseek-harness-relay#card-zh","repo":"sorsama/deepseek-harness-relay","commit":"3805fde389d616c985fe290ac9effd0b871eb51f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-relay（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness Web 配置提供独立的远程入口，在 harness 原有回环 Web 服务前启动第二个监听器，并将通过身份验证的 HTTP 与 WebSocket 请求转发到本机。它支持浏览器密码登录、二维码或一次性口令配对设备、逐台撤销设备、TLS 证书与公钥指纹，以及可选的本地网络服务发现。适合希望从手机或其他浏览器继续使用 Web 会话的人。无需额外 API Key 或账号；首次使用需在本机设置密码并配对设备，可选择自签名或自备证书。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:88-107","src/proxy/http.ts:48-92","src/proxy/ws.ts:86-135"]}
{"unit_id":"sorsama__deepseek-harness-relay#card-en","repo":"sorsama/deepseek-harness-relay","commit":"3805fde389d616c985fe290ac9effd0b871eb51f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-relay adds an authenticated listener in front of the loopback harness and proxies its web traffic for phones or other browsers. It supports password sign-in, QR pairing, per-device revocation, TLS certificates, and local service discovery. No API key or external account is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:88-107","src/proxy/http.ts:48-92","src/proxy/ws.ts:86-135"]}
